   "text": "Extension seams   (v1  \u2192  later)\n\nTransport\n   stdio  \u2192  WebSocket + token\nAgentLauncher\n   Docker \u00b7 Installed \u00b7 Host  \u2192  Remote\nSandboxProvider\n   Docker  \u2192  Modal \u00b7 Daytona\nModelGateway\n   direct key  \u2192  logging proxy\nQueue\n   SQLite  \u2192  Postgres\nResultStore / ArtifactStore\n   SQLite + disk  \u2192  Postgres + S3\nTrialRunner\n   local child  \u2192  remote worker",
